# Home Assistant sees everything; plants may only touch its own topics and Home Assistant's device discovery
# (mosquitto has no prefix wildcards, so that is all of homeassistant/device/, which nothing else uses).
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

user plants
topic readwrite plants/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/device/#
topic read homeassistant/status

# Frigate publishes detections, events and snapshots under frigate/ (Home Assistant reads them as MQTT entities).
user frigate
topic readwrite frigate/#
